For anyone using [Nginx Proxy Manager](https://nginxproxymanager.com/) with Nextcloud being hosted on a sub-participant34 instead of a sub-folder

I added the following lines to the 'Advanced' Tab:

```nginx
location = /ocs-provider {
    try_files $uri $uri/ /index.php$request_uri;
}

location ~ ^/ocm-provider {
    try_files $uri $uri/ /index.php$request_uri;
}
```

@participant28 Compare your config to the actual documented one. Yours does not match:

https://<redacted-host>/server/latest/admin_manual/installation/nginx.html

Please follow-up at the help forum - https://<redacted-host> - for further troubleshooting since this is not a bug.
